OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 119 Fri 27 NovC07:47/51
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws                 
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AImmigration stats are down but will    
OL,4,Athat be the end of the issue?          
OL,6,FIn the latter decades of the last      
OL,7,Fcentury, net migration was broadly net 
OL,8,Fzero. Sometimes more folk left than    
OL,9,Farrived. But, around the time that I   
OL,10,Ffirst arrived as a reporter in         
OL,11,FWestminster in 2004, the story was     
OL,12,Fchanging and would change rapidly.     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
