OL,3,AMajor Thanksgiving storm brings        
OL,4,Aflooding, flight delays across US      
OL,6,FA massive Thanksgiving storm hammering 
OL,7,Fthe Midwest and north-east with heavy  
OL,8,Frain and winds, along with high tides  
OL,9,Fout west, is causing widespread        
OL,10,Fdisruptions across the US.             
OL,12,FMore than 80 million Americans expected
OL,13,Fto be travelling this week. On Thursday
OL,14,F460 flights in the US were cancelled   
OL,15,Fand another 2,508 flights into, out of,
OL,16,For within the US were delayed, tracking
OL,17,Fsite FlightAware said.                 
OL,19,FThe FAA has previously warned that     
OL,20,Fdelays would be possible "throughout   
OL,21,Fthe week" as a result of the rain and  
OL,22,Fwind that are forecast.                
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
