OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew Zealand's ruling coalition falls   
OL,4,Ashort of parliamentary majority by one 
OL,5,Aseat                                   
OL,7,FThe incumbent National Party led by    
OL,8,FPrime Minister Christopher Luxon       
OL,9,Fsecured 40 out of 130 seats, while its 
OL,10,Fcoalition partners ACT and New Zealand 
OL,11,FFirst took 13 and 12 respectively.     
OL,13,FA government led by the centre-left    
OL,14,FLabour Party is not possible, official 
OL,15,Fresults on Friday show, as the bloc    
OL,16,Fwould not have enough seats even if    
OL,17,FOpportunity threw its weight behind it.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
